Sorry to post to the entire list, but I lost the email of the person that
asked this question.

/sbin/fddisk -fmt -f /dev/rdisk/floppy0a
disklabel -rw /dev/rdisk/floppy0a
newfs  /dev/rdisk/floppy0a
mount /dev/disk/floppy0a /mnt

Joe



